sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Agent as Agent + skill
    participant Proj as Project
    participant Docs as Docs
    participant Check as Checker
    participant Web as Browser
    Dev->>Agent: "Add comments"
    rect rgb(249, 249, 251)
        Note over Agent,Web: Read before writing
        Agent->>Proj: Read setup
        Proj-->>Agent: 8.10, Cloud, React
        Agent->>Docs: Comments page, version 8
        Docs-->>Agent: Needs tinycomments_mode
        Agent->>Check: Check current configuration
        Check-->>Agent: Baseline: no errors
    end
    Agent-->>Dev: Plan: embedded mode
    rect rgb(238, 241, 255)
        Note over Agent,Web: Change the minimum: plugin, buttons, tinycomments_mode
        Agent->>Proj: Add plugin
    end
    rect rgb(232, 246, 233)
        Note over Agent,Web: Verify
        Agent->>Check: Check changed configuration
        Check-->>Agent: No new findings
        Agent->>Web: Run the health check
        Web-->>Agent: Editable, plugin loaded
    end
    Agent-->>Dev: Report and links
